      "pdf_stroke_width_cm_values": [],
      "pdf_text": "A fine line follows the lift of the shore. Its small letters hold a \nquiet thought while the field guides each word. The page keeps \nevery mark in order, from the first word to the last. Along the \nbank the water folds back, and the light finds another way. Beyond \nthe bend a narrow path carries us past the reeds. Each step leaves \na quiet space for the next. We follow the curve until the river opens \nand the far bank comes into view.",
